Z||000000||Richard Parnell||09-30-1999||04:25 PM||||This has probably been covered before.  But I want to get a Getrag (spelling?) 5-spd tranny to replace the stock 5 spd Isuzu in my 87 SC, I heard they were a more durable trns.  It will be for the V8 I bought to stick in my car. Where can I find a true Getrag.  Are they in any other cars other than Fieros?||||reg||5
