Z||000002||ggarsk||09-30-1999||07:48 PM||||Richard,check out this site... <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Downs/8052/fierotech/gtrag.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Downs/8052/fierotech/gtrag.html</A>  It has all the cars you can get getrags out of and tips on installation and rebuilding.||||reg||1
