Z||000004||terryk||10-01-1999||01:43 AM||||I'd recommend you leave the Isuzu in there if the engine is an L4. The cost of the Getrag internal brass is just about more than the value of the car.<P>Yes, you can beat on the Getrag more, but when it blows, you'll love the price of a junkyard Isuzu. <P>Also, in 89 I believe, the Getrag changed from the VSS generator to the pickup coil. The outputs are not compatable and a box will be needed to change the pulses/mile to match the ECM/speedo in the car.||||reg||1
